SWAN (Simulating WAves Nearshore), version 41.51
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files: src/seastate_source.cpp, src/seastate_source.h

Parts of these files are C++ translations of SWAN routines: FAC4WW and
SWSNL1 (DIA quadruplets), FAC3WW and SWLTA (LTA triads), SWIND5 (wind
input), SWCAP with IWCAP 7 (whitecapping), SSURF (Battjes-Janssen
linearisation), SINTGRL (maximum energy) and SVEG (vegetation).

  SWAN (Simulating WAves Nearshore); a third generation wave model
