Eigen
------------------------------------------------------------------------
Eigen is a C++ template library for linear algebra, bundled unmodified
in ThirdParty/eigen-5.0.0. REEF3D uses the Dense (Core, LU, Cholesky,
QR, SVD, Geometry, Eigenvalues), Sparse and SparseLU modules and the
unsupported FFT module with its built-in kissfft backend. REEF3D is
compiled with EIGEN_MPL2_ONLY, so only Eigen code licensed under the
Mozilla Public License 2.0 (MPL2) is used. Individual Eigen source files
carry their own copyright notices from multiple contributors, and some
contain third-party code relicensed for Eigen under MPL2 (see
ThirdParty/eigen-5.0.0/COPYING.README and the source headers).

Full text: ThirdParty/eigen-5.0.0/COPYING.MPL2
See also: https://gitlab.com/libeigen/eigen/-/blob/master/COPYING.MPL2

Per the MPL 2.0, source code for any modified Eigen (MPL2-covered)
files must remain available under MPL 2.0 terms. REEF3D does not modify
Eigen; unmodified upstream source is used as-is.

